{"ocrText": "\"Les Whitehall wrote to inform me that\nI was having an af-\nfair with Hildon?\" Lucy said.\n\"He\njust mentioned\nit. He was\ntalking about\nseeing you\nagain.\"\n\"Where\nis he?\" Lucy said.\nMyra shrugged. \"I don't know him,\" she said.\n\"There wasn't a postmark?\"\n\"I\ndidn't\nnotice\nthe postmark.\nLucy:\n/ doni\ncare.\nI\njust\nwanted you to know.\"\nLucy\nsat on the\nstairs. \"Les doesn't care either,\" she\nsaid.\n\"It's just completely out of character for him to do anything\ninstinctively.\nI couldn't be more surprised.\"\n86", "textLayer": [{"text": "\"Les", "x": 15.5, "y": 4.54, "w": 5.54, "h": 1.75, "fontSize": 8.8}, {"text": "Whitehall", "x": 22.27, "y": 4.54, "w": 12.13, "h": 1.7, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "wrote", "x": 35.54, "y": 4.46, "w": 7.01, "h": 1.77, "fontSize": 8.9}, {"text": "to", "x": 43.65, "y": 4.69, "w": 2.32, "h": 1.47, "fontSize": 7.3}, {"text": "inform", "x": 47.11, "y": 4.49, "w": 8.25, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "me", "x": 56.54, "y": 4.13, "w": 3.51, "h": 2.22, "fontSize": 11.1}, {"text": "that", "x": 61.14, "y": 4.69, "w": 4.64, "h": 1.47, "fontSize": 7.3}, {"text": "I", "x": 67.11, "y": 5.09, "w": 0.71, "h": 0.9, "fontSize": 4.5}, {"text": "was", "x": 69.05, "y": 4.34, "w": 4.5, "h": 1.9, "fontSize": 9.5}, {"text": "having", "x": 74.74, "y": 4.46, "w": 8.25, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "an", "x": 84.08, "y": 4.56, "w": 2.61, "h": 1.65, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "af-", "x": 87.96, "y": 4.83, "w": 3.03, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 6.4}, {"text": "fair", "x": 12.46, "y": 7.06, "w": 4.12, "h": 1.3, "fontSize": 6.5}, {"text": "with", "x": 17.73, "y": 6.73, "w": 5.5, "h": 1.74, "fontSize": 8.7}, {"text": "Hildon?\"", "x": 24.45, "y": 6.65, "w": 11.47, "h": 1.81, "fontSize": 9.1}, {"text": "Lucy", "x": 37.2, "y": 6.55, "w": 6.16, "h": 1.95, "fontSize": 9.7}, {"text": "said.", "x": 44.64, "y": 7.0, "w": 5.31, "h": 1.34, "fontSize": 6.7}, {"text": "\"He", "x": 15.5, "y": 8.64, "w": 5.12, "h": 2.16, "fon